WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
The Kathmandu sample trip: 5 days, 2 travellers. Plan my trip.

00:01.500 --> 00:04.650
Four scouts start together: weather, places, guide, booking. (4× speed)

00:04.650 --> 00:07.150
The planner drafts every day; on the free tier this took 1 min 37 s. (38× speed)

00:07.150 --> 00:09.900
The quality gate sends 2 issues back, the reviser fixes them, the plan is approved. (5× speed)

00:09.900 --> 00:12.500
Ready after 2 min 1 s. Stops drop onto the map, one route per day. (real speed)

00:12.500 --> 00:14.750
Stays are sample quotes. Confirming one is simulated: nothing is booked or charged. (2.5× speed)

00:14.750 --> 00:17.550
Asking the assistant "Will it rain on day 3?" It opens the itinerary and checks the weather. (2–4× speed)

00:17.550 --> 00:20.100
The answer: no rain expected on day 3, with the source named. (real speed)
